sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sch as Scheduler (minute tick)
    participant Core as core + storage
    participant Msg as Messenger port
    participant U as User (TG/VK)

    Sch->>Core: for each user (in user tz)
    Core->>Core: reminders_on? not in quiet hours?<br/>next remind moment reached?
    alt no trigger moment
        Core-->>Sch: silent
    end
    Core->>Core: pending occurrences due today (any place)
    alt no tasks today
        Core-->>Sch: silent (no message at all)
    end
    Core->>Core: current_location fresh (now - set_at < TTL)?
    alt stale or unset
        Core->>Msg: ask_choice("Where are you now?", places)
        Msg->>U: 📍 Где вы сейчас? [Дом] [Работа] …
        U->>Msg: tap place
        Msg->>Core: save current_location
    end
    Core->>Core: filter occurrences by current place
    alt no tasks for this place
        Core-->>Sch: silent
    end
    Core->>Msg: digest text + buttons
    Msg->>U: 📋 Задачи «Работа»:<br/>1. Отчёт ⏰18:00 [✅][⏭]<br/>2. Созвон ⏰12:00 [✅][⏭]
    U->>Msg: ✅ task 1
    Msg->>Core: occurrence → done, completions row
